<title>UK: Huaneng Power sets $200 mln convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Huaneng Power sets $200 mln convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HUANENG POWER INTERNATIONAL INC</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     1.75	MATURITY   *21.MAY.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	LISTING    NYSE/LUX  PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.00	SELL CONC  1.50	DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p> NOTES	CONVERSION PRICE  -- $29.20 PER ADS (18 PCT PREMIUM)</p>
<p>		CONVERSION PERIOD -- 21.AUG.97-21.MAY.04</p>
<p>		THERE ARE 34.2466 ADS PER BOND.</p>
<p>		THERE IS A $30 MLN GREENSHOE OPTION.</p>
<p>	     *INVESTOR PUT OPTION AT 128.575 ON 21.MAY.02.</p>
<p>		CALL AT PAR AFTER 3 YEARS SUBJECT TO 130 PCT HURDLE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
